msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Kodida ko'rganlaringizni Traktga skrobbl qiladi va kutubxonangizni Trakt bilan sinxronlaydi"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Trakt Relay Kodida ko'rgan filmlar, qismlar, jonli TV va yozuvlaringizni Traktga skrobbl qiladi hamda kutubxonangizni u bilan sinxronlaydi: kolleksiya, ko'rilganlik holati, baholar va ijro jarayoni, har bir yo'nalish sozlamalarda yoqiladi. Ko'rib bo'lganingizdan so'ng baho so'raydi, kontekst menyusi esa baholaydi, ko'rish ro'yxatiga qo'shadi va serialni qayta ko'rishni boshlaydi. Muvaffaqiyatsiz skrobbllar keyinroq qayta uriniladi.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay Trakt.tv, Razzeee va uning hissa qo'shuvchilari tomonidan yaratilgan script.trakt ning o'zgartirilgan versiyasidir."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Trakt Relay Trakt bilan bog'liq emas va Trakt tomonidan ma'qullanmagan."

